{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1382429-comic-book-and-scion-fans","id":1382429,"title":"Comic Book and Scion Fans","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-18T20:00:02-07:00","id":1382429,"title":"Comic Book and Scion Fans","content":"What do you guys think o the 25 issues run of Jason Aaron on Thor:God Of Thunder? I found it very much like a game of Scion on Demigo and God level.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-19T22:04:35-07:00","id":1382681,"title":"","content":"It was often hit or miss. I preferred Fraction and Straczynski much more, and Donny Cates' run looks promising so far.<br /> <br /> Aaron had an interesting depiction of Allfather Thor but it seemed contradictory the longer it went on, first he was 10k years in the future and claimed he was All Father far Longer then Odin, then we discover Odin was All Father for over a Million Years, and then they have All Father Thor a general untold epoch of years in the future.<br /> <br /> Like I really liked some of the Dialogue like Odin being the Glory and the Wonder and the Way. But at the same time the Omnipotence City, the City of the Gods in space was very unoriginal and unsatisfying. And it didn't make sense how Thors Grandchildren just seemed to be arrested in perpetual youth while he had the rest of the Futureverse age and crappify.<br /> <br /> I thought Gor the Godbutcher was a greatly exaggerated in the praise it deserved, but at the same time his depictions of both Young and Old Thor have been Brilliant. But we already had the exact character of Gor the God Butcher, anyone remember a decade Earlier we had Desak the Godslayer, an alien Mortal empowered by a MacGuffin to slay the Gods out of vengeance? It made Gor feel like a rip off character, or at best Aaron didn't do his homework on a run from just a few years Earlier. I felt if we had Jane Foster as Thor it would have worked better if normal Thor actually died, instead it was weird that two people both had the full power of Thor... that is a net positive of one extra Thor and that is silly, it would have made sense if say Thor Died because oh his strength and skills went to her, but instead it just copied on her. Also not a fan of just killing off Jane Fosters Husband and Kids just so Aaron could make use of her as a single woman open for romantic tangles, loosing your family should have always weighed over her head but since they were inconvenient they just wrote them off and it detracted from the character. Also not a fan of treating her Cancer as a gimmick, with the plot of oh we can't cure her because magic has a price. It would have been more poignant if she actually did die to save the Universe, but as it was portrayed there was no consequences and it was used a purely as a gimmick. It worked well with the Death of Captain Marvel because it had consequence, but here they kept telling us oh its costing her her life, then wait no it didn't.<br /> <br /> Odin was ruined, he was almighty before, and ruthless but at the same time wise and with compassion. But Aaron made Thor have too many daddy issues and Odin was just a petty impotent fool. They even ruined characters like Cul, who had such damn weight to his introduction in Fear Itself. His reintroduction was cheap and made him feel like he never should have been such a threat, I mean this was the guy who broke Caps shield after waking up from a Nap.<br /> <br /> Malekith though was a given spotlight and he did a good job making him Ruthless and interesting and sad. But War of the Realms was over hyped and when it came it seemed insignificant, and was a meaningless cashgrab at that point because you knew none of it would matter after the event was up, the Earth wouldn't be shaken up from almost being enslaved by the creatures of Myth blah blah.<br /> <br /> Early in his run Mangog was treated as a joke, and made minor Appearances, but at the end of the Run he really played him up while at the same time making the Destroyer Suck. And all of a Sudden Mjolnir and the Mangog cant survive the Sun? Thor has literally walked on the sun a few times, and later he crucified himself on the Sun at the end of the run.<br /> <br /> Aaron can be interesting with his writing on Avengers, but his Thor run felt Gimmicky and hit or miss. Bringing Malekith and Roxxon back into prominence were his biggest successes. Unworthying Thor in a stupid way was a big failure, and then when Hickmen had Thor earn Worthiness back in an epic and Emotional way when Thor and Hyperion Died fighting the Host of Beyonders, it was all undone and Aaron being jealous just ignored the store and just said it never happened after the Secret War reshuffle. It was brilliant Thor used an Alternate Universe Mjolnir that only the Unworthy could Wield, and when at the end of time he could no longer wield it to save the Universe it was such an emotional scene that hit all the right marks, he lost his weapon but regained all his spirit and confidence... theeen Aaron just has it that that never happened.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-20T12:24:05-07:00","id":1382805,"title":"","content":"All very good points <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar754_2.gif');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"754\" data-vbnamecard=\"754\">Eldagusto</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}